#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:2 220d4f5b20bb41e09c6fe5e65fd5ef7d
msgid "_`Metadata Configuration`"
msgstr "元数据配置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:5 9ff071ce05c544408b17a79fc200a286
msgid "_`Project-level Settings`"
msgstr "项目级设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:7 04252c20e3f24897a044c752f4bbd130
msgid ""
"The metadata.json file is the single source of truth for "
"food_volume_measure. It carries the package identity together with every "
"build, dependency and documentation switch, so the CMake configuration, "
"the Conan recipe and the documentation pipeline all read the same values "
"instead of duplicating them."
msgstr ""
"metadata.json 文件是 food_volume_measure 的唯一事实来源。它承载包标识以及所有构建、依赖与文档开关，因此 "
"CMake 配置、Conan 配方与文档流水线读取的都是同一份取值，无需重复定义。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:10 ae8ff0fd1dd44cf6b17f014c0a29597c
msgid "_`File Structure`"
msgstr "文件结构"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:12 cb3c48a387ca494fb6887d214bd88cba
msgid ""
"The JSON file is organized in sections: the package identity (name, "
"target, version, team, license, description, authors, maintainers, "
"topics, url and homepage), the build configuration (cmake_version, "
"build_cppstd, build_cstd, build_type, activate_code_coverage, is_shared, "
"is_header, generate_modules_inplace, std_modules and user_modules), the "
"dependencies object, baremetal_white_list, graphviz_bin, the "
"documentation settings (doc_languages, doc_versions, doc_doxygen_folders "
"and doc_doxygen_suffix), and the automation switches (trigger_tests, "
"saving_tests_log, enable_python_bindings and workflow_triggers)."
msgstr ""
"该 JSON "
"文件按块组织：包标识（name、target、version、team、license、description、authors、maintainers、topics、url"
" 与 "
"homepage）、构建配置（cmake_version、build_cppstd、build_cstd、build_type、activate_code_coverage、is_shared、is_header、generate_modules_inplace、std_modules"
" 与 user_modules）、dependencies "
"对象、baremetal_white_list、graphviz_bin、文档设置（doc_languages、doc_versions、doc_doxygen_folders"
" 与 "
"doc_doxygen_suffix），以及自动化开关（trigger_tests、saving_tests_log、enable_python_bindings"
" 与 workflow_triggers）。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:15 d1ebd8dd76d84ca396d7d9c1b664b69b
msgid "_`Key Settings`"
msgstr "关键设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:17 ddc777c480c4468e8e3d8502c72c3e10
msgid ""
"The build configuration fixes the toolchain expectation and the language "
"standards used for the library targets. The dependencies object is split "
"into four buckets - common, c, cpp and infra - and every entry maps a "
"Conan package name to the CMake targets that should be linked into the "
"matching library. baremetal_white_list names the packages that survive a "
"bare-metal cross build. The documentation settings decide which languages"
" and versions are generated and which folders and file suffixes Doxygen "
"scans."
msgstr ""
"构建配置确定工具链预期以及库目标所使用的语言标准。dependencies 对象分为四个分桶——common、c、cpp 与 "
"infra——每个条目把 Conan 包名映射到应链接进对应库的 CMake 目标。baremetal_white_list "
"列出在裸机交叉构建中保留的包。文档设置决定生成哪些语言与版本，以及 Doxygen 扫描哪些目录与文件后缀。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:20 ea5c3e15ade54442b3747310e54a33c6
